  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">창의재단에서 만든 소눈해부 가상실험이 없어져서.. 아날로그로 눈모형만들기 준비해보았습니다!<br>&#160;<br>옛날 신과수에서 유튜브에 올려준 모형을 기본으로 하되<br>&#160;<br>전화선모양의 머리끈으로 다양한 색과 패턴은 물론 크기조절의 성질을 가진 홍채를 표현,<br>&#160;<br>얇은 볼록렌즈는 조절기능이 없으므로 1차로 빛을 모으는 각막을 표현,<br>&#160;<br>요즘 유행하는 실리콘 테이프 물공으로 조절가능한 성질을 가진 수정체를 표현해보았습니다.<br>(실리콘테이프 물풍선만들기 참고)<br><a href=\"https://youtube.com/shorts/nMZTmPCIMeY?si=UuE1F-DB5WlrB1Si\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtube.com/shorts/nMZTmPCIMeY?si=UuE1F-DB5WlrB1Si</a><br><br></p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eb4c20ea9a4e9a1cf66de7c41945e4d415c1b65c\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\" style=\"width:64.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eb4c20ea9a4e9a1cf66de7c41945e4d415c1b65c\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c516a62c94700b6bd338ddc4aa24278d54b58aaa\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\" style=\"width:36.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c516a62c94700b6bd338ddc4aa24278d54b58aaa\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f26504db76a609a72ac8703817ccfc2591cb7108\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f26504db76a609a72ac8703817ccfc2591cb7108\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/580760427038105b29f7abe9b0f68d585d2ede01\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/580760427038105b29f7abe9b0f68d585d2ede01\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumc