xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">물공렌즈 양옆을 당겨 얇아지게 하거나 접착부분을 더 늘려 렌즈를 두껍게 해보세요</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">www.canva.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>AI 시대에 다시 대세는 아날로그!<br><br>&lt;꿀팁&gt;<br>홍채색깔은 가위바위보로 우선권 주기<br>하나씩 조립하며 빛을 비춰보기<br>1) 볼록렌즈 조립 후 플래쉬 빛이 모이는 것 확인<br>2) 홍채 조립한 부분은 빛이 투과하지 못해 그림자가 지는 것 확인<br>3) 물공 당겨서 얇게 하면 플래쉬 빛이 모였다가 퍼졌다가 하는 것 확인<br></p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/34d6081613c9aaefb15506c3f7255ae7015e2568\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1920\" style=\"width:42.86%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/34d6081613c9aaefb15506c3f7255ae7015e2568\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ace62477cd4efc37ff925eaad755a1b8f6b8605d\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\" style=\"width:57.14%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ace62477cd4efc37ff925eaad755a1b8f6b8605d\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8528f668f031d9a0d2aecbeaf0e07fe99bf0918d\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8528f668f031d9a0d2aecbeaf0e07fe99bf0918d\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e4a44666addfd4795f8abcbdb3e8266ff26b0470\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\" style=\"width:33.33%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e4a44666addfd4795f8abcbdb3e8266ff26b0470\" class=\"txc-ima